::  name       styled frame
::  shape      lines + an OPTIONAL style: token sheet (WADE1 surface bridge)
::  invariant  each line non-empty; each style token is `key value` flat Bron
::  example    a dark sheet — Bark paper, Flax ink — over three drawn lines
::  readers    Brushstroke · tokens.rye (infuse cascade) · Skate styled runs
::  nib        surface-wade1-v0
::
::  Thin .brush fixture — WADE1 surface-bridge seam (p23 parser + style: block).
::  Parser begun. Describes how a value at a nib is drawn as Frame, and the
::  token sheet it dresses with. The style: block reassembles into flat Bron
::  that tokens.rye's infuse cascade and dress lower to Skate paint.
::  Tongue: Glow · Bron · TAME · Radiant. Never JS · HTML · CSS · JSON.
::  Reader: brushstroke/brush_parse.rye (pins + style sheet) → brushstroke/tokens.rye.
::
::  at-nib:     brushstroke-styled
::  present:    Frame
::  max-lines:  8
::  style:
::    paper 0xFF2B2620
::    ink 0xFFF2ECDF
::    edge 0xFF8A7A66
::    space 4
::  lines:
::    styled frame
::    drawn from a token sheet
::    Bark paper, Flax ink
::  refuse:     src/web · Wasm/Web backend · CSS rail · a { } stylesheet
